# Registry auth is NOT configured here — it is injected per-run by
# actions/setup-node (registry-url) in the cli job of .github/workflows/release.yml,
# so no token ever lives in the repo.
#
# Resolved: packages publish to npmjs under the @augmentd-labs scope.
# The unscoped name `canvas-cli` belongs to an unrelated package on npmjs,
# so the CLI publishes as @augmentd-labs/canvas-cli. Its user-facing command
# is still `canvas`, and the `client/app/canvas-cli` protocol identifiers are
# unaffected by the package name.
#
# Note: onlyBuiltDependencies lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml under pnpm 10, not here.
